WEBVTT

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.980
You can go on ahead.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.770
I can wait for you...

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.110
I feel bad about always making you wait.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.680
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.890
Kazama-kun's on duty today?

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.020
Yeah.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.400
She's surprisingly diligent
for someone with breasts like that.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.880
Isn't she just a librarian? It'd be fine
even if she were to skip her turn.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.100
It wouldn't be fine,
and breasts have nothing to do with this.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.040
See you later?

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:28.130
So... why are we having
a study session at my house?

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.880
It's not a study session.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.810
We're here to devise a plan for the establishment of the Girls' Club!

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.860
You still haven't given up on that?

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.070
Why would we give up?

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.140
The teacher rejected our proposal.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:45.560
Really, her complete lack of
understanding is most troubling.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.640
This must be what they mean by the deterioration of public education.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:54.090
It was probably a wise decision, though.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:58.050
I still don't know what
this club is actually supposed to do.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.790
In that case, I guess we have to come up with a long-term plan.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.410
You heard me, right?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.910
It's fine! You're good at studying anyway,
so a minor distraction won't matter.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.880
So you realize that this is a distraction?

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.080
That really doesn't sound good.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:18.420
Sumika-san, I've brought some tea and snacks for you and your friends.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.140
Thank you.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.600
Are you Murasame-kun's mother?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.240
She's our housekeeper, who lives with us.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.490
My name is Hayasumi Noe.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.440
I'm Hachisuka Tomoe.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.940
I'm Taema Miyako.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.160
Thank you ever so much for always taking care of Sumika-san.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:47.240
I've been raising Sumika-san as if she were my own since she was a little girl,

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.090
breast feeding her and changing her diapers.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:55.860
I've been taking care of her
as if she were my own daughter.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:00.670
Even now, she sometimes can't fall asleep unless she's sleeping together with me.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.920
Oh my...

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.570
Sleeping together?

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:08.250
Mama, it's so soft and fluffy!

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.560
You're quite the spoiled baby, Murasame-kun!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.020
I don't do that!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.000
Furthermore, you've only been with us for three years!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.360
But I have proof right here!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.520
It's a composite!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.060
I'm borrowing your dictionary!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.840
Don't touch other people's desks!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.500
It's fine; we're friends, aren't we?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.830
Who's friends with whom?!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.910
Oh, picture found!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.190
I'm going to draw a mustache!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.250
Stop it!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.840
Go home already!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.680
Looks delicious.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.410
Don't eat all the snacks!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.130
I have an old photo album here—

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.620
They're all composites!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:59.020
A study session? At my place?

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.680
Yes.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:05.560
For some reason, Murasame-kun no longer wants us to use her house.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:08.300
Ah, how troubling!

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.530
Look who's talking.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:10.910
Me!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:16.920
Besides, you two don't even
know the situation at Kazama's.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:20.730
I don't mind, but my home is rather small.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:23.800
Are you sure? What about your brother's work?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.340
Yes, his work is in a lull at the moment, so it's fine.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.410
Anyway, Sumi-chan,

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.930
more importantly...

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.980
...I haven't seen Akemi-chan around!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:45.390
I asked the teacher, but she said that there's no transfer student by that name!

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:49.050
You're right. I haven't seen her around, either.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:56.750
Actually, on the contrary, she might be around here somewhere.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.750
What a run-down apartment complex.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:24.230
Eh?! What is this?!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.500
It's all books!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.240
They're all my brother's.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.700
I'm surprised that your parents don't complain.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:39.130
Our parents... aren't around.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.800
Really? Why?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.040
Miyako!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.700
That's rude.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.710
I'm sorry.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.780
If anything, you should apologize to Kazama-kun.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.610
So, she's not just a simpleton.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.810
That aside...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:07.960
...Kazama is getting changed in there right now!

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.940
What are you fantasizing about now?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.950
Don't you watch her change all the time during PE?

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:22.050
I suspect that there's a
different flavor to this, though.

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.840
Don't peek into other people's thoughts!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:32.340
We must first find ourselves a faculty advisor!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.850
No, I take it back; she really is just a simpleton.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:44.980
Still, don't you have your own room?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:50.060
Not even elementary students have to use the dining table as a desk.

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:54.240
Well, I have a room, but...

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.970
Throw it out already.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.210
How about you take these to an antique bookstore right now?

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.730
No way! Half of these are mine!

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:14.440
Geez! Like brother, like sister.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.760
Over here!

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:30.470
Mustache! Must draw a mustache!

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.130
No! Stop!

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:34.260
Mustache! Must draw a mustache!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.830
Hello. Oniichan?

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:44.210
I have some friends over right now.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.830
Okay, I got it.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.730
Dinner at seven?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.010
Did your brother say he's coming home?

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.490
Yes, I have to prepare dinner.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.450
You can go on without me.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.010
I'll help you.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.220
Don't worry about it.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.810
It's just my nature.

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.970
Tomoe-chan is an expert at cooking.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.280
Really? That's a surprise.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.660
She looks great with an apron on.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:24.380
Kazama looks ten times better in an apron!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:26.380
My Honey!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.600
Darling!

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:32.880
If I had come here by myself,
it would've been as if we were newlyweds!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:38.850
Sumi-chan, would you like to have dinner first,
or would you prefer to take a bath?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:47.120
Or maybe... me?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:52.440
Damn it! If only women could marry each other!

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:58.300
I see — so that's why your eyes
occasionally turn predatory.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.950
I told you to stop peeking!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:05.810
Well, I understand where you're coming from.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.490
I, too...

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.340
I'm home, Miyako!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.090
Welcome home!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.900
Would you like to have dinner?

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:18.140
A bath?

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:23.850
Or maybe... me?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.100
All of it!

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.380
Oh, come on!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:40.700
Hey! Concentrate on your studies.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.760
Why are you wearing that?

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:49.620
The aprons are coincidentally being washed.

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:55.560
You wouldn't normally
find these in just any household.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.630
My brother gets them from work.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:10:59.850
We have plenty of others.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.150
What's his job?

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.180
Like other designs and colors...

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.640
He writes for magazines and such.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:08.890
I have one that'd fit Sumi-chan too;
should I get it out?

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:14.030
Oh, I'm fine.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:19.400
I see; you probably can't cook.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:28.290
It would seem that anything remotely feminine is impossible for "Raging Blade Murasame."

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.390
Look who's talking!

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:37.640
Even though you act like a proper girl, don't tell me that you actually leave it all up to your partner?

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.480
The rule is 30 minutes, one dish!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.120
The decision will be...

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.230
...made by our partners
after tasting them blindfolded!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:00.620
Um, what about dinner?

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.820
Ah, how troubling.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.680
The loser becomes the winner's dog!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.830
Don't regret it later!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.550
To battle!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.670
That's Kazama-san's...

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:32.980
Oh Sumika-san, you really need to work some on your feminine side.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:36.510
I guess that's what makes you cute, though.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:44.050
Just who invented food that explodes if you fail to prepare it properly?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.990
You mean it wasn't you?

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:59.200
I'm sorry, Kazama. Your books...

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.560
Don't worry about it.

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:05.410
My brother won't mind
as long as they are readable.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.090
They'll mold if you leave them like this, though.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:16.510
It's because I tried to do something
I wouldn't normally do.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.840
You two really bought a lot.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.530
What were you planning to make?

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:32.300
I know; how about you all have dinner here?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:39.790
We have so many ingredients, and Sumi-chan and Miyako-chan can help out with the easier tasks.

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:43.050
We should all cook and eat together!

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:46.130
I'm sure it'll be both fun and delicious!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.390
You may have a point.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.810
Eh? I don't want to touch fish and such.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.520
It's all right.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.450
I can teach you anything you don't know how to do.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.180
Right, Sumi-chan?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.620
I'm...

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:06.950
...going home!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:07.700
Sumi-chan!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.180
Sei!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.870
Don't try to run.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:25.460
You see, contrary to what some great teacher may have said,
there are times when a girl has do what she must.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.000
One day.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.470
K-K-Kazama?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.590
I won't!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.000
I'm not going to get married!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.980
Don't be so childish!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.980
What a bother.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:44.370
A moment please, Kazama-kun.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.970
Sumi-chan.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:59.250
I want to eat the food you cook.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.390
Leave it to me!

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.010
So easily swayed.
Leave it to me!

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:13.650
I see. Sumi-chan has a soft spot for spoiled children.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:16.430
She has some masculine qualities.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.380
This might have had the opposite effect...

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.640
My apologies, Murasame-kun.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.330
Did you cut yourself?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.460
I'm fine.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.230
Oh no!

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.410
Look, it's bleeding...

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.900
Kazama...

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:48.770
That's what she's imagining, no doubt.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:51.670
Murasame-kun is a man at heart.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.680
I told you to stop peeping!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:55.930
Here.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:16:01.910
Ah! It stings!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.100
Um, excuse me.

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.210
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.220
Thank you.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.130
Hello.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.400
Yes, I'm on my way home.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.140
It's research!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:51.630
This is still my main source of income.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.640
Well, I'd love to be able to make
a living as a novelist, but...

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:08.000
...it seems like there are those who read them.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.120
My sister?

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.630
She's doing well.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:20.860
She has a lot on her mind,
but she often helps out at home.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.640
I want to encourage her.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:31.150
She's had a hard time given the situation at home.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:36.000
But now she's made great friends
and is having fun every day.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.090
Yes, I'll talk to you later.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.670
Oh, my brother's home.

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.600
Oh my...

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.830
I'm terribly sorry.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.260
This is delicious.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:10.740
I'm just glad that I bought extra.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:15.010
When you said friends,
I thought that girl would be here too.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.360
That girl?

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:22.470
Heya! Club activity's over, so I'm here now.

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.730
Maid café?

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.630
You're late, Master.

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.100
See you later!

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:53.500
There's no mistaking that easygoing attitude —
he has to be Kazama-kun's brother.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.660
I had no idea you were cooking.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.880
I should've just skipped club activities and come over.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.660
Are you good at cooking, Torioi-kun?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.660
Very good.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.500
At eating, right?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:16.000
Perhaps I should get Noe-san to teach me.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.930
That's a good idea.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.810
Before any more people are hurt, that is.

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:22.880
You're one to talk.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.870
You two are getting along fine.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:26.000
Who is?!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.400
Ushio!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.780
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.260
She has such potential.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:47.460
If only she weren't in the brass band,
I'd love for her to join us.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.980
Kiyori-chan is normal, though.

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:55.680
Besides, do we really need to make it a club?

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:58.260
Can't we just hang out like we did today?

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.550
What are you saying?

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:01.300
High school is all about clubs!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:05.910
Yeah, yeah. She really is a fool.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.090
That said, you have my thanks.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.690
Because the two of us have always been like this.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:18.930
We never really had anyone
whom we could call a friend.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:26.440
As lovers, just having each other is enough,
but with friends, the more the merrier.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.780
So, I had a lot of fun today.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.150
Thank you.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.690
Then, let us meet again in our dreams, Murasame-kun.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.040
You should just tell her already!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.410
Even if it doesn't work out,
she's dumb and would soon forget about it.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.870
Hey, what did you say?

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:52.100
See you!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.180
I'm home.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.880
Welcome back, Sumika-san.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:13.370
Noe-san, would you teach me how to cook sometime?

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.130
Friends, huh?

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:38.320
Indeed...

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.760
...I had a lot of fun today too.

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.790
School really is fun.

00:23:48.470 --> 00:23:50.590
See you next week!
